# Hungering Puppetbeast's "{1}, Sacrifice another artifact" chooses the artifact as the cost is paid, once the mana
# abilities have been activated (CR 601.2g-h by way of 602.2b). Bot1 pays the {1} with Lotus Petal, sacrificing it for
# its own cost; it is no longer on the battlefield, so it can't also be the artifact sacrificed for Puppetbeast's (CR
# 118.3, 400.7): the Heartwood token Puppetbeast made as it entered is the only one offered, and is the one sacrificed.
# Puppetbeast gets its +1/+1 counter and haste.

